OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,FThe UK will see showers over the
OL,7,Fcoming days but the rain is "not going
OL,8,Fto solve the drought situation
OL,9,Fovernight", a forecaster has said.
OL,11,FSome areas in the country will have
OL,12,Fthe "first meaningful rain for a long
OL,13,Ftime" this week, the Met Office said,
OL,14,Fafter a summer of heatwaves and dry
OL,15,Fweather have left many areas facing
OL,16,Fwater shortages.
OL,26,@oD@]OUqD@JO]tD@EOUuD@EO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
