CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787100482
OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,FHowever, they said the rainfall would
OL,7,Fnot be a "huge amount" and "highly hit
OL,8,Fand miss from place to place", before
OL,9,Fconditions became drier again over the
OL,10,Fweekend.
OL,12,FIn an online forecast, Met Office
OL,13,Fmeteorologist Aidan McGivern said
OL,14,FWednesday would be a "very showery
OL,15,Fday" across the UK, with Northern
OL,16,FIreland and areas in western and
OL,17,Fcentral Scotland seeing "frequent
OL,18,Fshowers with heavy downpours, hail and
OL,19,Fthunder".
OL,26,@oD@JOUoD@VO]oD@\OUpD@]O]vD@VOUwD@DO]yD@
OL,26,AYOU{D@HO]
