OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787100482
OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,FThe showers would be "fewer and
OL,7,Ffurther between" in southern areas,
OL,8,Fwhile central England and eastern
OL,9,FWales could still see some downpours,
OL,10,Fthe forecaster added.
OL,12,FHe said: "I suspect many people across
OL,13,FEngland and Wales will at least enjoy
OL,14,Fthe feel of some rain falling out of
OL,15,Fthe sky during the next few days, but
OL,16,Fit's not going to solve the drought
OL,17,Fsituation overnight because we're not
OL,18,Fexpecting huge amounts and it will be
OL,19,Fhighly variable because a lot of it
OL,20,Fwill come in the form of showers."
OL,26,@nD@VOUoD@PO]tD@JOU|D@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
