OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, highs of 25C in London,
OL,7,F20C in Cardiff, 19C in Manchester and
OL,8,F16C in Glasgow are expected, according
OL,9,Fto the weather service.
OL,11,FThursday will begin with some "very
OL,12,Fheavy rain" across parts of northern
OL,13,FEngland and north and west Wales with
OL,14,Ffrequent showers in the southwest, Mr
OL,15,FMcGivern said.
OL,17,FThat afternoon will bring a "better
OL,18,Fchance" of showers further south and
OL,19,F"dumping a reasonable amount of rain
OL,20,Fin places", he added.
OL,26,@sD@_OUtD@KO]yD@]OUzD@GO]{D@AOU|D@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
