OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,F"But again, because they're showers,
OL,7,Fit will be hit and miss, very speckled
OL,8,Fin nature," he said.
OL,10,FTemperatures will be below average for
OL,11,Fa large part of the UK on Thursday,
OL,12,Fwhich is "something we've seen on only
OL,13,Fa handful of days this summer," the
OL,14,Fforecaster continued.
OL,16,FA hosepipe ban began for all of Wessex
OL,17,FWater's 1.4 million customers across
OL,18,Fareas in Bath, Somerset, Dorset and
OL,19,FWiltshire on Tuesday.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@KO]tD@JOUuD@_O]
