CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787100482
OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,FIt is the first ban the company has
OL,7,Fput in place for 50 years, since the
OL,8,Fsummer of 1976.
OL,10,FMeanwhile, Thames Water has urged its
OL,11,Fcustomers to continue to reduce water
OL,12,Fusage as it said household demand has
OL,13,Ffallen by 3% across London and more
OL,14,Fthan 6% across the Thames Valley and
OL,15,Fhome counties since it introduced a
OL,16,Fhosepipe ban on July 23.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
