PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787100482
OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,FIn an update on Tuesday, the utility
OL,7,Fsaid London reservoir storage was at
OL,8,F74%, which is lower than the firm
OL,9,Fwould expect for this time of year but
OL,10,Fthe Farmoor Reservoir in Oxfordshire
OL,11,Fwas 92% full.
OL,13,FAccording to the company, rainfall in
OL,14,Fthe Thames catchment area during July
OL,15,Fwas less than 1mm, which is just 2% of
OL,16,Fthe long-term average, while customers
OL,17,Fused about 100 million litres more
OL,18,Fwater every day than normal, putting
OL,19,Fmore pressure on rivers, reservoirs
OL,20,Fand the water network.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
