PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1787100482
OL,3,CRain in coming days won't solve
OL,4,Cdrought overnight ` forecaster
OL,6,FMore than 27 million people across
OL,7,FEngland have now had hosepipe use
OL,8,Frestricted in their area after months
OL,9,Fof hot and dry weather.
OL,11,FThe cooler and wetter conditions come
OL,12,Fafter the UK's fifth heatwave of the
OL,13,Fsummer, during which the hottest day
OL,14,Fof the year was recorded in Kew
OL,15,FGardens, London, on Thursday when
OL,16,Ftemperature reached 38.1C.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
